flowchart LR
    A[Raw data] --> B[Data versioning: DVC]
    B --> C[Feature store]
    C --> D[Training pipeline]
    D --> E[Experiment tracking: MLflow]
    E --> F[Model registry]
    F --> G[CI/CD: test, validate, package]
    G --> H[Serving: batch or online]
    H --> I[Monitoring: latency, drift, quality]
    I --> J{Drift or decay?}
    J -- Yes --> K[Trigger retrain]
    K --> D
    J -- No --> H
